00:01:44.471 --> 00:01:47.941 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les gens. C'est la solution,

00:01:45.672 --> 00:01:49.142 size:53% position:73% line:53%
moi, je pense.

00:01:46.873 --> 00:01:50.343 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- C'est la solution, se parler.

00:01:48.041 --> 00:01:54.214 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Or, nos hommes, en général,

00:01:49.242 --> 00:01:55.382 size:53% position:73% line:53%
