00:02:48.168 --> 00:02:55.175 size:53% position:73% line:53%
être ni psychologue ni...

00:02:52.873 --> 00:02:56.376 size:53% position:73% line:53%
J'aurais voulu avoir un gros

00:02:54.074 --> 00:02:57.577 size:53% position:73% line:53%
