00:03:07.654 --> 00:03:12.859 size:53% position:73% line:53%
♪ ♪ ♪

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:14.060 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- En lisant "Un homme, tout

00:03:11.758 --> 00:03:15.262 size:53% position:73% line:53%
