00:03:18.498 --> 00:03:23.203 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Quand je suis partie

00:03:19.699 --> 00:03:24.404 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de l'école Gédéon-Ouimet,

00:03:20.901 --> 00:03:28.742 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en 7e année, la plupart

00:03:23.303 --> 00:03:29.910 size:53% position:73% line:53%
