00:03:24.504 --> 00:03:31.111 size:53% position:73% line:53%
allaient travailler.

00:03:28.875 --> 00:03:35.882 size:53% position:73% line:53%
À 12 ans, 13 ans. Alors moi,

00:03:30.010 --> 00:03:37.083 size:53% position:73% line:53%
