00:03:35.982 --> 00:03:39.519 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Puis, il a-tu essayé

00:03:37.183 --> 00:03:40.720 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de me décourager en m'offrant

00:03:38.418 --> 00:03:41.922 size:53% position:73% line:53%
