00:03:44.324 --> 00:03:47.828 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Pour laver des couches?"

00:03:45.525 --> 00:03:49.029 size:53% position:73% line:53%
C'était ça que les pères

00:03:46.726 --> 00:03:50.230 size:53% position:73% line:53%
