00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:54.534 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Alors, j'ai lavé des couches

00:03:51.531 --> 00:03:56.870 size:53% position:73% line:53%
aussi, mais... et tout

00:03:53.467 --> 00:03:58.038 size:53% position:73% line:53%
