00:03:54.634 --> 00:03:59.239 size:53% position:73% line:53%
J'ai... Moi, j'apprends.

00:03:56.970 --> 00:04:00.440 size:53% position:73% line:53%
J'aime apprendre. J'apprends

00:03:58.138 --> 00:04:02.208 size:53% position:73% line:53%
