00:03:59.339 --> 00:04:05.879 size:53% position:73% line:53%
C'est ça, ma vie.

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:07.047 size:53% position:73% line:53%
C'est très simple.

00:04:02.342 --> 00:04:08.248 size:53% position:73% line:53%
♪ ♪ ♪

00:04:05.979 --> 00:04:09.149 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Depuis que je suis entré

