00:04:18.892 --> 00:04:22.395 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Vous êtes rendue à combien?

00:04:20.093 --> 00:04:23.597 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- 2000.

00:04:21.294 --> 00:04:24.798 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- 2000.

00:04:22.495 --> 00:04:25.999 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- 2000. J'en ai lu... j'ai dit :

00:04:23.697 --> 00:04:27.200 size:53% position:73% line:53%
"Je vais en lire 2-3."

00:04:24.898 --> 00:04:28.401 size:53% position:73% line:53%
J'ai passé un été à lire

00:04:26.099 --> 00:04:29.603 size:53% position:73% line:53%
