00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:33.306 size:53% position:73% line:53%
C'est tellement passionnant!

00:04:28.501 --> 00:04:34.474 size:53% position:73% line:53%
C'est notre histoire!

00:04:29.703 --> 00:04:35.675 size:53% position:73% line:53%
C'est notre histoire.

00:04:33.406 --> 00:04:36.877 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Mais vous allez faire quoi

00:04:34.574 --> 00:04:38.078 size:53% position:73% line:53%
