00:04:35.775 --> 00:04:39.279 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ah, je vais faire un livre.

00:04:36.977 --> 00:04:40.480 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Pas un autre livre!

00:04:38.178 --> 00:04:41.681 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Oui. Oui. Le prochain livre,

00:04:39.379 --> 00:04:42.883 size:53% position:73% line:53%
il est déjà commencé,

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:44.117 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et je ne suis pas seule,

00:04:41.781 --> 00:04:48.822 size:53% position:73% line:53%
